<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a seventh tranche of two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Aug 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  6.00 pct   vs    6.60 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.98 pct   vs    7.58 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  88.00	 vs   86.85</p>
<p>Bids			5.267 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a fifth tranche of August 31, 1998 Ctzs on September 25.</p>
</text>
